## MERGE-03 — Document, OCR and normalization pipeline

- Added a farmer-only `/api/greenfin/documents` API using the existing GFES session and CSRF controls.
- Added PDF/JPEG/PNG/WebP/XLSX MIME, size and file-signature validation plus SHA-256 duplicate detection.
- Stores original GreenFin documents in the existing R2 binding under farmer-isolated keys.
- Added an OCR provider interface and a `MockOcrProvider`; every mock result is explicitly labelled `DEMO` or `SIMULATED`.
- Added OCR field confirmation/correction and deterministic field normalization for dates, amounts and hectares.
- Produces traceable standardized records and advances document status through `OCR_COMPLETED`, `FIELDS_CONFIRMED` and `NORMALIZED`.
- Writes `DOCUMENT_UPLOADED`, `OCR_COMPLETED` and `FIELD_CORRECTED` audit events.

